    "name": "Arctic 51",
    "steam_appid": 2434110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.poster.avif?t=1713866191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.webm?t=1713866191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.mp4?t=1713866191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A routine expedition to find a habitable planet doesn't go according to plan, resulting in Captain Fleming's ship being wrecked. In search of shelter from the storm, he finds traces of an intelligent civilization \u2014 many abandoned buildings and devices that clearly have a purpose. Where did the creatures that built all this go, and why was the icy planet considered habitable?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on the role of Captain Fleming in a single-player campaign. Find a way to fix the ship and return home.<br></li><li>Solve original puzzles by combining four types of energies.<br></li><li>Explore the mysterious frozen complex and control alien devices with the energy cubes.<br></li><li>Use your flamethrower to burn your way through the ice and enemies. Connect parts of the complex with networks of tunnels, but be cautious; you're not alone here.<br></li><li>Embark on an adventure with your loyal, witty AI companion. Find out the reason for the disappearance of civilization and the icing of the entire planet.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.poster.avif?t=1713866191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.webm?t=1713866191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434110/extras/05e0e6e9068a5f990d3ef6d99a3984ae.mp4?t=1713866191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A routine expedition to find a habitable planet doesn't go according to plan, resulting in Captain Fleming's ship being wrecked. In search of shelter from the storm, he finds traces of an intelligent civilization \u2014 many abandoned buildings and devices that clearly have a purpose. Where did the creatures that built all this go, and why was the icy planet considered habitable?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on the role of Captain Fleming in a single-player campaign. Find a way to fix the ship and return home.<br></li><li>Solve original puzzles by combining four types of energies.<br></li><li>Explore the mysterious frozen complex and control alien devices with the energy cubes.<br></li><li>Use your flamethrower to burn your way through the ice and enemies. Connect parts of the complex with networks of tunnels, but be cautious; you're not alone here.<br></li><li>Embark on an adventure with your loyal, witty AI companion. Find out the reason for the disappearance of civilization and the icing of the entire planet.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arctic 51 is a unique mix of puzzles, action, and metroidvania in a sci-fi setting. Explore a mysterious complex hidden under the surface of an icy planet, control alien devices by combining different types of energies, and unravel the mystery of the disappearance of an entire civilization.",
    "supported_languages": "Russian, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
