        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or Intel Core i7 6700K or newer is recommended<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 2070 Super 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"
